# CODEOWNERS
# Docs: https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/managing-your-repositorys-settings-and-features/customizing-your-repository/about-code-owners
#
# Each line is a pattern followed by one or more owners.
# Owners can be GitHub usernames, team slugs (@org/team), or email addresses.
# The LAST matching rule takes precedence.

# ── Default owner for everything ──────────────────────────────────────────────
*                               @your-org/backend-team

# ── CI / workflow changes require DevOps review ───────────────────────────────
.github/                        @your-org/devops-team

# ── Source code ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
src/main/java/                  @your-org/backend-team
src/test/java/                  @your-org/backend-team @your-org/qa-team

# ── Configuration & build ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
pom.xml                         @your-org/backend-team @your-org/devops-team
src/main/resources/             @your-org/backend-team

# ── Security-sensitive files ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
src/main/resources/application-prod.yml   @your-org/security-team
